       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. DRIVER.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-DATE   PIC X(10).
       01 WS-FMT    PIC X(10).
       01 WS-RESULT PIC X(80).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           ACCEPT WS-DATE FROM ENVIRONMENT "STUB_DATE"
           ACCEPT WS-FMT  FROM ENVIRONMENT "STUB_MASK"
           CALL 'CSUTLDTC' USING WS-DATE, WS-FMT, WS-RESULT
           DISPLAY WS-RESULT
           DISPLAY "RC=" RETURN-CODE
           STOP RUN.
